Z||000010||SwissFormula||12-21-2001||01:33 AM||||How did you get all this information?<P>All i know about my T-top Formula is that it has C&C tops, no aftermarket ones.<P>------------------<BR>Roy<P>88 Formula, T-Top<BR>1 of 20 Fieros in Switzerland||||reg||1
Z||000011||RossT||12-21-2001||01:47 AM||||All fiero t-tops are C&C  <P>1250 88's or so were ordered with t-tops and delivered to the dealership that way.  They have the RPO code "CJB"<P>about 2000 c&c kits were made and installed in 84-88's after the cars were delivered to the dealership.  C&C installed many of those kits.  These cars do not have the "CJB" RPO code.<P>if your car has the CJB code than go to  <A HREF="http://www.fierottop.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierottop.com</A>  and plug your vin# in.<BR>Ray Paulk runs the site and wants to know where all CJB car are located!!<P>He can give you all that info that you are looking for.<P>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 12-21-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 12-21-2001).]||||reg||1
